      "content": "but that's just more noise. the \"meaning\" is just more data to process. it doesnt feel real. everything feels so artificial and empty. like, if a program has a bug that just makes it run in circles without purpose, doesnt it just make more sense to just delete the file? why keep running a loop that achieves nothing?",
